name: sim.readCustomDataBlock
description: Deprecated. See sim.readCustomStringData and sim.readCustomBufferData instead
luaSynopsis: bytes customDataBlock = sim.readCustomDataBlock(int objectHandle, string tagName)
pythonSynopsis: buffer customDataBlock = sim.readCustomDataBlock(int objectHandle, string tagName)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the object, or sim.handle_scene if the data is stored in the scene, or sim.handle_app if the data is stored in the application's current session
2. tagName: string that identifies the data
outputs:
1. customDataBlock: the custom data block
